{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/x71nbSyYxCL8O6QPlffHIg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:26.244832+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/x71nbSyYxCL8O6QPlffHIg","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYiausDvnGmEtHWIyvX3MlBIbzKNGLlSk160h07Btm1vjkIPnbichUAXibVEEF8iaHHEM2rEUDYUgEJHRA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z5xrVdnntYiausDvnGmEtHWIyvX3MlBIbyh1KBCcNS9MpHPGTfuBbe93SwEHBxHgB6d1EWHvtTfKtHPx4p9TdJA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/gSQUeibVLfBricl6fBqMj3qu9zkibhTFYMjRYjRZ6oAeiakiaIcwBqb7OZ9AR7yKDZobWFal2yVCJDibD1tV4WzRA5mag2vfKODj1ibu7T6xmJGaib0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z5xrVdnntYiausDvnGmEtHWIyvX3MlBIbHSJ0A2OFBzueFpHhU29mt00jNSrUWveC7T37icxSGznQcE0hYjejMcw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><section><section><section><span>中国科学院苏州生物医学工程技术研究所（以下简称“中国科学院苏州医工所”）2027级推免生预报名工作即日起启动。为方便考生提前准备，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名单位</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span>中国科学院苏州医工所（中国科学技术大学生物医学工程学院（苏州），学院代码：174）</span></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>  </span></span></p><p><font><span>请登录中国科学技术大学研究生报考服务系统</span></font><span>https://xspt.ustc.edu.cn/</span><font><span>，进入</span></font><font><span>“</span></font><font><span>推免生预报名</span></font><font><span>”</span></font><font><span>，选择中国科学院苏州医工所</span></font><font><span>(</span></font><font><span>中国科大生物医学工程学院（苏州）</span></font><font><span>)</span></font><font><span>，学院代码：</span></font><font><span>174</span></font><font><span>，按照报名要求填写信息和上传相关材料（已参与过科学营的同学</span></font><font><span>无需</span></font><font><span>参加</span></font><font><span>本次预报名</span></font><font><span>）。</span></font></p><p><font><span>网上报名时间：即日起至</span></font><span>9</span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>1</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>17:00</span></font><font><span>。</span></font></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>面试时间及地点</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><font><span>拟定于</span></font><font><span>2026</span></font><font><span>年</span></font><span>9</span><font><span>月</span></font><font><span>16</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><font><span>-1</span></font><font><span>7</span></font><font><span>日</span></font><span>在苏州医工所举行</span><font><span>。</span></font></p><p><font><span>以上安排如有变动，另行通知。</span></font></p><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>1. </span><font><span>热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></font></p><p><span>2. </span><font><span>具有</span></font><font><span>生物医学工程、物理、材料、人工智能、计算机、软件、电子、机械、光学、控制、生物</span></font><font><span>等相关专业或相近专业的在学大三本科生（</span></font><span>2027</span><font><span>届毕业生）；</span></font></p><p><span>3. </span><font><span>对科研工作有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力；</span></font></p><p><span>4. </span><font><span>英语达到国家四</span></font><font><span>/</span></font><font><span>六级水平（</span></font><font><span>425</span></font><font><span>分以上）；</span></font></p><p><span>5. </span><font><span>有意报考我所</span></font><font><span>2027</span></font><font><span>级硕士研究生，在学期间学习成绩优秀，对有出色科研成果的申请者成绩标准可适当放宽；</span></font></p><p><span>6.</span><span> </span><font><span>导师简介及研究方向可在我所网站研究队伍中查询，网址：</span></font><span>https://sibet.cas.cn/yjsjy2020/dsxx/</span><span><font><span>。</span></font></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>1. </span><b><font><span>网报时所有信息务必详细准确填写，</span></font></b><font><span>请自觉保证提供材料的真实性，研究所将会对材料进行复核。（材料如有不实将取消</span></font><font><span>申请</span></font><font><span>资格）。</span></font></p><p><span>2. </span><font><span>材料提交：</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>1</span><font><span>）报名登记表（网上报名后生成的表格打印后</span></font><b><font><span>必须本人手写签名）</span></font></b><font><span>；</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>2</span><font><span>）有效身份证件正反面扫描件；</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>3</span><font><span>）学生证扫描件（含个人信息页和学期注册页）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>4</span><font><span>）</span></font><font><span>截止目前的</span></font><font><span>成绩单（</span></font><b><font><span>有学校教务部门或所在院系公章</span></font></b><font><span>）与总评成绩排名证明（</span></font><b><font><span>有学校教务部门或所在院系公章</span></font></b><font><span>）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>5</span><font><span>）外语水平证明材料（大学生英语四</span></font><font><span>/</span></font><font><span>六级、托福、雅思等证书）；</span></font></p><p><font><span>（</span></font><span>6</span><font><span>）个人能力证明材料（能体现自身能力的获奖证书复印件、专利、学术论文等）；</span></font></p><p><b><font><span>将以上所有申请材料（含各种证明材料）按线上提交顺序汇总至一个</span></font><span>PDF</span><font><span>文件，上传到报名系统的</span></font><font><span>“</span></font><font><span>个人所有资料汇总</span></font><font><span>”</span></font><font><span>处，否则将视为材料不完整</span></font></b><font><span>。</span></font></p><section><section><section><span><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>材料审核及录取</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></span></section><p><font><span>研究</span><span>所将对报名材料进行初选，并择优录取。</span><font><span>面试名单将在研究生面试申请系</span></font><font><span>统上公布并通过系统短信通知；未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></font></font></p><section><section><section><font><span><section><section><section><span><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYg6AJ5zVGQRLXxhOqVlAK6XRDE0iaZoqnfjuVDZ4y4putlfdd4B5EqUMGqNricDaw48LUE29UeBKqtg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></span></section></section></section></span></font></section></section></section><p><span>联系部门：研究生处</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：yanjiusheng@sibet.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0512-69588022、69588025</span></p><p><span>单位官网：http://www.sibet.ac.cn/</span></p><p><font><font><span><br/></span></font></font></p></section></section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> THE END</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/z5xrVdnntYiausDvnGmEtHWIyvX3MlBIbyh1KBCcNS9MpHPGTfuBbe93SwEHBxHgB6d1EWHvtTfKtHPx4p9TdJA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section></section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z5xrVdnntYiausDvnGmEtHWIyvX3MlBIbibelMHpmMJCjdaXNYNhic7udOcS61styo0WVvj8DvQliaxC6qUX76ez0A/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></span></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cfbfcf165d24511ee74383acbeb9cbd8cb031f77e317913ed259eadf7d990fad","textLength":1098,"sourceSha256":"13808268fe43b93fee5674eaa1cf430ac6443f46cb9f460cf400afd9927ca06e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a727223761e9836fac7e","title":"2026年中国科学院苏州生物医学工程技术研究所关于2027级推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:26.244832+00:00"}
